      "platform": "x",
      "text": "You know what time it is! I\u2019m LIVE on The Stephen A. Smith Show on @MadDogRadio! \n\nI don\u2019t care if you don\u2019t agree with me\u2026that\u2019s fine! Call today between 1pm - 3pm today give me your best take! BE PREPARED!!! \n\n\u260e\ufe0f: 888-623-3646\n\ud83c\udfa7: sxm.app.link/MadDogRadio",
