    {
      "voiceId": "stephen-a-smith",
      "voiceName": "Stephen A. Smith",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "See! You know it\u2019s pretty bad when we can\u2019t even blame either side of the aisle. This is about Trump, his pettiness and his refusal to let stuff go. The man is back in office and still looking to prove he never lost four years earlier. And because of that he\u2019s willing to let TSA workers go unpaid! Anything to be able to say \u201cI was right!\u201d It\u2019s an addiction!\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/stephenasmith/status/2036440679354691682",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-24T13:51:07+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "stephen-a-smith",
      "voiceName": "Stephen A. Smith",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Sorry! We know I won\u2019t hesitate to blame the Dems for much these days, but you can\u2019t put it on them when even The Republicans went to Trump with a deal to fund DHS and he refused unless the Dems push the SAVE ACT! Thats not about the Dems. That\u2019s not about the GOP. That is about POTUS.#CarryOn\n\n\nBo Loudon (@BoLoudon)\n\n\ud83d\udea8BREAKING: Hakeem Jeffries just BLEW THE COVER of Democrats and ADMITTED DEMOCRATS are the ones responsible for refusing to fund DHS and TSA.\n\nIt sure would be a shame if this vide",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/stephenasmith/status/2036419290916667808",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-24T12:26:08+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
